  "operative_text": "Section 1 (Md. Code Ann., Public Safety § 5-305(c)): (c) As part of the application for a criminal history records check, the Secretary shall submit to the Central Repository: (1) UNLESS THE APPLICANT’S FINGERPRINTS ARE ALREADY ON FILE WITH THE DEPARTMENT OF STATE POLICE, two complete sets of the applicant’s legible fingerprints taken on forms approved by the Director of the Central Repository and the Director of the Federal Bureau of Investigation;"
